# Session handoff docs (dev-only, not for the app bundle). Listed explicitly
# rather than relying on /se_* above — that pattern is lowercase and this
# machine's git has core.ignorecase=true, so it silently also matched these
# uppercase filenames here but would NOT match them on a case-sensitive
# system (e.g. EAS Build's Linux runners), causing a real tracked/ignored
# mismatch between environments. EAS's tarball step correctly flagged this
# as "inconsistent filename casing" and refused to build until fixed.
/SE_MODEL_HANDOFF.md
/SE_REPULL_HANDOFF.md
/SE_EXPANSION_PULL_HANDOFF.md
